flowchart TB
    Start(["원본 영상 입력"]):::start
    Probe["영상 정보·프레임 확인"]:::input
    Backend{"감지 백엔드 선택"}:::decision
    TransNet["TransNetV2<br/>프레임 전환 확률 추론"]:::ai
    Light["PySceneDetect<br/>경량 감지"]:::process
    Boundary["새 샷 시작 프레임 변환<br/>경계 보정"]:::process
    Merge["짧은 씬 병합<br/>공통 씬 데이터"]:::process
    Clips["FFmpeg 씬 클립<br/>기본 재인코딩"]:::output
    Meta["썸네일·JSON/CSV"]:::output
    Timeline["EDL·OTIO·FCP7 XML"]:::output
    Check["출력 프레임·경계 검사"]:::process
    Review{"누락·과검출 확인"}:::decision
    Tune["소재별 감지 설정 조정"]:::process
    Use["클립·편집 타임라인 활용"]:::output
    Start --> Probe
    Probe --> Backend
    TransNet --> Boundary
    Light --> Boundary
    Boundary --> Merge
    Merge --> Clips
    Merge --> Meta
    Merge --> Timeline
    Clips --> Check
    Meta --> Check
    Timeline --> Check
    Check --> Review
    Backend --> |"딥러닝"| TransNet
    Backend --> |"경량"| Light
    TransNet -.-> |"의존성 사용 불가"| Light
    Review --> |"설정 조정 필요"| Tune
    Review --> |"검토 후 활용"| Use
    Tune -.-> |"사용자 조정 후 재실행"| Backend
    classDef start fill:#176c62,stroke:#176c62,color:#ffffff
    classDef input fill:#e8f2fb,stroke:#83a7c4,color:#24475d
    classDef process fill:#f6f7f8,stroke:#afb9c1,color:#33424e
    classDef ai fill:#f0ebf9,stroke:#a897be,color:#4f3c68
    classDef decision fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#c5a363,color:#65502e
    classDef store fill:#edf4ec,stroke:#92af8b,color:#385733
    classDef output fill:#e6f3ec,stroke:#80aa94,color:#28543f
    classDef error fill:#fbede8,stroke:#c29482,color:#744a3d
